WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.288 line:8%
Open the student's enrolment and compare unapplied credit with remaining instalments.

00:00:06.295 --> 00:00:11.124 line:8%
Choose Apply credit and check the target instalment and amount before saving.

00:00:12.141 --> 00:00:15.362 line:8%
Check the resulting allocation and remaining credit.

00:00:15.362 --> 00:00:20.884 line:8%
Applying credit uses money already recorded; it is not a new collection.
